claims.falsifier:
The Portrait is revised or fails if:

1. the video CJheycD09Hg, or any unresolved token, proves to carry a method-bearing practitioner's singular distinction into the answer;
2. repeated compositions at these addresses, or on other surfaces, carry the field's singular distinctions (the ceremony made up; precommitment; the one-voice count);
3. construction sources are found supporting frame, definition or contender lines;
4. the crown persists unchanged where the frame sources are absent, which would make the scaffold decorative and the dependency edge of 9.4 false;
5. the discipline's own addresses compose AEO without the manipulation frame, which would confine G′ to the title addresses;
6. an independent valuer, from the same evidence, produces a materially different Portrait (§28).

